<title>BRAZIL: Brazilian soybean and product market.</title>
<headline>Brazilian soybean and product market.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers reported the following Brazilian soybean, products basis levels.</p>
<p>(NS - no seller T-Trade P-Premium D-Discount, NB - no bidder)</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS	  MONTH	   PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soybean (cents per bushel)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> Aug	     20 P/NS  P     Aug	   35 P/NS</p>
<p> Sept	     115/140 P     Sept	   120/150  P</p>
<p> Apr 1998	   2/5   P     Apr 1998    even/3    P</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS	  MONTH	   PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soymeal/Pellets (dollars per short tonne 48 pct profat)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> Aug		 NB/NS   D	August	  NB/NS   D</p>
<p> Sept		 2/5    P	Sept	     2/6    P</p>
<p> Oct		 17/22   P	Oct	     18/24   P</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	 BASIS	   MONTH	  PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soybean Oil (dollars per tonne, points per lb, crude, degummed)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> August	   150/180 P	August	 145/180  P</p>
<p> Sept	     150/180 P	Sept	   140/180  P</p>
<p> Oct		140/180 P	Oct	    140/180  P</p>
